---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import podcastImg from '../assets/5.png';
---

<BaseLayout title="Servicios" description="Mis servicios y portafolio profesional.">
  <div class="container page-content">
    <header class="page-header">
      <h1>Servicios</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Estos son algunos de los servicios que ofrezco. Pero, como buen colombiano, lo que no sé, lo aprendo. </p>
    </header>

    <div class="services-grid">
      <div class="cards-wrapper">
        <div class="service-card" data-service="software">
          <button class="service-header" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="service-tag">Astro • React • Node • TypeScript</span>
            <h3>Software Engineering</h3>
            <span class="expand-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                <line x1="10" y1="4" x2="10" y2="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <line x1="4" y1="10" x2="16" y2="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="service-content">
            <div class="service-inner">
              <p class="service-description">Diseño y desarrollo de productos web a medida, desde la arquitectura hasta el despliegue. Código limpio, escalable y pensado para crecer.</p>
              <div class="sub-projects">
                <a href="https://lacasadeloscolibris.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="sub-project-card">
                  <span class="tech-tag">Astro</span>
                  <h4>La Casa de los Colibrís 🐦</h4>
                  <p>Diseño de marca y sitio web completo para un refugio de descanso y espiritualidad en Alocén, España.</p>
                  <span class="project-link">Visitar sitio →</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://promotoravivendum.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="sub-project-card">
                  <span class="tech-tag">Astro • WordPress</span>
                  <h4>Vivendum 🏡</h4>
                  <p>Evolución continua del sitio web de una inmobiliaria: actualizaciones de contenido, mejoras técnicas y mantenimiento activo.</p>
                  <span class="project-link">Visitar sitio →</span>
                </a>
                <a href="https://explounas2-nicolasarevalos-projects.vercel.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="sub-project-card">
                  <span class="tech-tag">HTML • CSS • JavaScript</span>
                  <h4>Explouñas 💅🏼</h4>
                  <p>Sitio web a medida para un emprendimiento de manicura, con diseño visual cuidado pensado para atraer y convertir clientas.</p>
                  <span class="project-link">GitHub →</span>
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="https://galeria.niiico.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="service-card service-link">
          <div class="service-header">
            <span class="service-tag">Fotografía</span>
            <h3>Galería fotográfica</h3>
            <span class="redirect-icon">↗</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a href="/" class="service-card service-link">
          <div class="service-header">
            <span class="service-tag">Blog • Narrativa</span>
            <h3>Escritura creativa</h3>
            <span class="redirect-icon">↗</span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <div class="service-card" data-service="locucion">
          <button class="service-header" aria-expanded="false">
            <span class="service-tag">Podcast • Voz comercial • Doblaje</span>
            <h3>Locución</h3>
            <span class="expand-icon">
              <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none">
                <line x1="10" y1="4" x2="10" y2="16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <line x1="4" y1="10" x2="16" y2="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </button>
          <div class="service-content">
            <div class="service-inner">
              <div class="service-text-col">
                <p>Tu marca necesita una voz, esta es la mía. Me enfoco en voz comercial, doblaje empresarial y producción de podcast. Tono profesional, cercano y memorable.</p>
                <div class="service-links">
                  <a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/1gFBa3gI7d9FTKTB6KRY6e?si=mHYJHseYSWmZofb08cdynA" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="service-action-link">5MENTARIOS podcast →</a>
                  <a href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="service-action-link">Voice123 →</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <a href="https://open.spotify.com/show/1gFBa3gI7d9FTKTB6KRY6e?si=mHYJHseYSWmZofb08cdynA" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="podcast-link">
                <img src={podcastImg.src} alt="5MENTARIOS podcast" class="podcast-image" />
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-section">
        <a href="mailto:contacto@niiico.com" class="contact-button">Contáctame</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="titulaciones-section">
      <h2>Titulaciones y Educación</h2>

      <div class="badges-container">
        <a href="https://niiico.com/_astro/inge.64d8bbb7.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="badge">
          <span class="badge-title">Ingeniero de Software</span>
          <span class="badge-meta">Universitario ↗</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://niiico.com/_astro/sistemas.36abc9c0.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="badge">
          <span class="badge-title">Técnico en Sistemas</span>
          <span class="badge-meta">SENA ↗</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://niiico.com/_astro/scrum.b75839b4.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="badge">
          <span class="badge-title">SCRUM Fundamentals</span>
          <span class="badge-meta">Certificado ↗</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://niiico.com/_astro/udw.4ab5ce98.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="badge">
          <span class="badge-title">Desarrollo Web</span>
          <span class="badge-meta">Udemy ↗</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://niiico.com/_astro/pjs.ddccc43e.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="badge">
          <span class="badge-title">Profesional Javascript</span>
          <span class="badge-meta">Platzi ↗</span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://niiico.com/_astro/id.2f6d16cd.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="badge">
          <span class="badge-title">Inglés para Developers</span>
          <span class="badge-meta">Platzi ↗</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div id="prof-alert" class="newsletter-alert">
      <span class="alert-icon">😉</span>
      <p>Pídemela por correo</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<script>
  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {
    const wrapper = document.querySelector('.cards-wrapper');
    const grid = document.querySelector('.services-grid');
    const cards = wrapper.querySelectorAll('.service-card:not(.service-link)');
    let expandedCard = null;

    cards.forEach(card => {
      card.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        if (e.target.closest('a')) return;

        if (expandedCard === card) {
          collapseCard(card);
        } else {
          if (expandedCard) resetCard(expandedCard);
          expandCard(card);
        }
      });
    });

    function resetCard(card) {
      card.style.position = '';
      card.style.top = '';
      card.style.left = '';
      card.style.right = '';
      card.style.bottom = '';
      card.style.zIndex = '';
      card.style.display = '';
      card.style.flexDirection = '';
      card.style.transform = '';
      card.style.transformOrigin = '';
      card.style.opacity = '';
      card.style.transition = '';
      card.classList.remove('expanded');
      card.querySelector('.service-header').setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
      const otherCards = wrapper.querySelectorAll('.service-card.dimmed');
      otherCards.forEach(c => c.classList.remove('dimmed'));
      grid.classList.remove('has-expanded');
      expandedCard = null;
    }

    function expandCard(card) {
      expandedCard = card;
      grid.classList.add('has-expanded');

      const first = card.getBoundingClientRect();
      const gridRect = wrapper.getBoundingClientRect();

      card.dataset.origLeft = first.left - gridRect.left;
      card.dataset.origTop = first.top - gridRect.top;
      card.dataset.origWidth = first.width;
      card.dataset.origHeight = first.height;

      card.style.position = 'absolute';
      card.style.top = '0';
      card.style.left = '0';
      card.style.right = '0';
      card.style.bottom = '0';
      card.style.zIndex = '10';
      card.style.display = 'flex';
      card.style.flexDirection = 'column';

      const last = card.getBoundingClientRect();
      const dx = first.left - last.left;
      const dy = first.top - last.top;
      const sx = first.width / last.width;
      const sy = first.height / last.height;

      card.style.transformOrigin = '0 0';
      card.style.transform = `translate(${dx}px, ${dy}px) scale(${sx}, ${sy})`;
      card.style.opacity = '0';
      card.querySelector('.service-header').setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');

      const otherCards = wrapper.querySelectorAll('.service-card:not(.expanding)');
      otherCards.forEach(c => { if (c !== card) c.classList.add('dimmed'); });

      requestAnimationFrame(() => {
        card.style.transition = 'transform 0.35s ease, opacity 0.25s ease';
        card.style.transform = 'translate(0, 0) scale(1, 1)';
        card.style.opacity = '1';
        card.classList.add('expanded');
      });

      card.addEventListener('transitionend', function onEnd() {
        card.style.transition = '';
        card.removeEventListener('transitionend', onEnd);
      });
    }

    function collapseCard(card) {
      card.querySelector('.service-header').setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
      card.style.transition = 'opacity 0.2s ease';
      card.style.opacity = '0';

      const onEnd = () => {
        card.style.position = '';
        card.style.top = '';
        card.style.left = '';
        card.style.right = '';
        card.style.bottom = '';
        card.style.zIndex = '';
        card.style.display = '';
        card.style.flexDirection = '';
        card.style.transform = '';
        card.style.transformOrigin = '';
        card.style.opacity = '';
        card.style.transition = '';
        card.classList.remove('expanded');

        const otherCards = wrapper.querySelectorAll('.service-card.dimmed');
        otherCards.forEach(c => c.classList.remove('dimmed'));

        grid.classList.remove('has-expanded');
        expandedCard = null;
        card.removeEventListener('transitionend', onEnd);
      };

      card.addEventListener('transitionend', onEnd);
    }

    const badges = document.querySelectorAll('.badge');
    const alert = document.getElementById('prof-alert');

    if (alert && badges.length > 0) {
      badges.forEach(badge => {
        badge.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
          e.preventDefault();
          alert.style.display = 'flex';
          alert.offsetHeight;
          alert.classList.add('show-alert');
          setTimeout(() => {
            alert.classList.remove('show-alert');
            setTimeout(() => {
              if(!alert.classList.contains('show-alert')) {
                alert.style.display = 'none';
              }
            }, 400);
          }, 3000);
        });
      });
    }
  });
</script>

<style>
  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .page-header h1 {
    font-size: 3.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
  }

  .subtitle {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  .contact-button {
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    background-color: #050505;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.3s ease, color 0.3s ease;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .contact-button::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--accent-color), #da70d6);
    border-radius: 6px;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
    z-index: -1;
  }

  .contact-button:hover {
    border-color: transparent;
    color: #fff;
  }

  .contact-button:hover::before {
    opacity: 1;
  }

  .services-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 5rem;
  }

  .cards-wrapper {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    height: 420px;
  }

  .service-card[data-service="software"],
  .service-card[data-service="locucion"] {
    grid-column: span 2;
  }

  .service-card {
    position: relative;
    background-color: #050505;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .service-card.service-link {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .service-card.service-link:hover .service-header h3 {
    color: var(--accent-color);
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.4);
  }

  .redirect-icon {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.5rem;
    right: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
  }

  .service-card.service-link:hover .redirect-icon {
    color: var(--accent-color);
    transform: translate(2px, -2px);
  }

  .service-content::-webkit-scrollbar,
  .service-inner::-webkit-scrollbar {
    width: 5px;
  }

  .service-content::-webkit-scrollbar-track,
  .service-inner::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
    background: transparent;
  }

  .service-content::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb,
  .service-inner::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
    background: rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.25);
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .service-content::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover,
  .service-inner::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
    background: rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.4);
  }

  .service-content,
  .service-inner {
    scrollbar-width: thin;
    scrollbar-color: rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.25) transparent;
  }

  .service-card.dimmed {
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }

  .service-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.3);
  }

  .service-header {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: inherit;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-align: left;
    width: 100%;
    font-family: inherit;
    position: relative;
  }

  .service-tag {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: #c084fc;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .service-header h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, text-shadow 0.2s ease;
    padding-right: 2rem;
  }

  .service-card:hover .service-header h3 {
    color: var(--accent-color);
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.4);
  }

  .expand-icon {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.5rem;
    right: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .service-card.expanded .expand-icon {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
    color: var(--accent-color);
  }

  .service-content {
    flex: 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 0 1.5rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .service-card.expanded .service-content {
    overflow-y: auto;
  }

  .service-description {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .service-inner p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .service-inner p:last-of-type {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .sub-projects {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .sub-project-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background-color: #080808;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 6px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .sub-project-card:hover {
    border-color: rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.3);
  }

  .sub-project-card .tech-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: #c084fc;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .sub-project-card h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    margin: 0 0 0.35rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, text-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .sub-project-card:hover h4 {
    color: var(--accent-color);
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.4);
  }

  .sub-project-card p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .project-link {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    transition: color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .sub-project-card:hover .project-link {
    color: var(--accent-color);
  }

  .service-card.expanded .service-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 0;
  }

  .service-card[data-service="locucion"].expanded .service-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .service-card[data-service="locucion"].expanded .service-text-col {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 0;
  }

  .service-card[data-service="locucion"].expanded .service-links {
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .service-card[data-service="locucion"].expanded .podcast-link {
    margin: 0;
    align-self: start;
  }

  .service-card[data-service="locucion"].expanded .podcast-image {
    width: 100%;
    max-height: 250px;
    object-fit: contain;
    object-position: top center;
  }

  .service-links {
    margin-top: auto;
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    padding-top: 1rem;
  }

  .podcast-link {
    display: block;
    border-radius: 6px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: box-shadow 0.25s ease;
    margin: 0.5rem 0;
  }

  .podcast-link:hover {
    box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.35);
  }

  .podcast-image {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .service-action-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--accent-color), #da70d6);
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    background-clip: text;
    transition: filter 0.2s ease;
  }

  .service-action-link:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.2) drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.4));
  }

  .titulaciones-section h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
  }

  .badges-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-bottom: 4.5rem;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    background-color: #080808;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
    border-radius: 50px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.2s ease;
  }

  .badge:hover {
    border-color: rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.4);
    background-color: #0c0c0c;
  }

  .badge-title {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: color 0.2s ease, text-shadow 0.2s ease;
  }

  .badge-meta {
    color: var(--text-tertiary);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  .badge:hover .badge-title {
    color: var(--accent-color);
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.4);
  }

  .newsletter-alert {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 2rem;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(100px);
    background-color: #000;
    border: 1px solid rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.4);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 0 20px rgba(147, 51, 234, 0.2);
    padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.68, -0.55, 0.265, 1.55);
    z-index: 9999;
  }

  .newsletter-alert.show-alert {
    transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(0);
    opacity: 1;
    pointer-events: auto;
  }

  .alert-icon {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
  }

  .newsletter-alert p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .services-grid {
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .cards-wrapper {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      grid-template-rows: auto;
